{"run_id": "20260802T132734-hepkg", "qid": "gen-set-8fb0a41b", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses measured Fiducial cross section ratio W/Z?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql", "merged_entities"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The graph records 12 distinct analyses that measured the fiducial cross section ratio W/Z or related observables. Here are the papers and the specific observables they measured:\n\n- **Paper ID: 2103.04956**\n  - Observable: Inclusive fiducial cross section \\( \\sigma_{\\text{fid}}(pp \\to H \\to 4\\ell) \\)\n\n- **Paper ID: 2110.11231**\n  - Observable: Fiducial WZ production cross section (particle-level fiducial region)\n\n- **Paper ID: 2207.12246**\n  - Observable: Observed (fiducial-volume) total elastic cross section\n\n- **Paper ID: 2308.02285**\n  - Observables:\n    - Fiducial inclusive cross section \\( \\sigma(W+c) \\), particle level\n    - Cross section ratio \\( R_c^{\\pm} = \\frac{\\sigma(W+ + \\bar{c})}{\\sigma(W- + c)} \\), inclusive\n\n- **Paper ID: 2312.04450**\n  - Observable: Inclusive \\( t\\bar{t}Z \\) fiducial cross section (70 < \\( m_{f\\bar{f}} \\) < 110 GeV)\n\n- **Paper ID: 2401.05299**\n  - Observable: Fiducial \\( t\\bar{t}W \\) production cross-section\n\n- **Paper ID: 2404.06204**\n  - Observables:\n    - Differential fiducial cross section vs W-boson transverse momentum (\\( p_T^W \\))\n    - Ratio of normalised \\( W(\\pm) \\) to Z differential cross sections vs \\( p_T \\)\n    - Integrated fiducial cross section for \\( W-, W+ \\) and Z production\n    - Ratio of integrated fiducial cross sections (between processes or between centre-of-mass energies)\n    - Ratio of fiducial cross sections extrapolated to the CMS fiducial phase space\n\n- **Paper ID: 2408.03744**\n  - Observables:\n    - Fiducial inclusive cross section times branching fraction, \\( W- \\to l- \\nu\\bar{r} \\)\n    - Fiducial inclusive cross section times branching fraction, \\( Z \\to l+l- \\) (60-120 GeV)\n    - Fiducial cross section ratio \\( W+/W- \\)\n    - Fiducial cross section ratio \\( W/Z \\)\n    - Total cross section ratio \\( W+/W- \\)\n    - Total cross section ratio \\( W/Z \\)\n    - Ratio of fiducial \\( W+ \\) cross section between 13 and 5.02 TeV\n    - Ratio of fiducial \\( W- \\) cross section between 13 and 5.02 TeV\n    - Ratio of fiducial inclusive \\( W \\) cross section between 13 and 5.02 TeV\n    - Ratio of fiducial \\( Z \\) cross section between 13 and 5.02 TeV\n    - Double ratio: fiducial \\( (W+/W-) \\) ratio at 13 TeV over 5.02 TeV\n    - Double ratio: fiducial \\( (W/Z) \\) ratio at 13 TeV over 5.02 TeV\n    - Ratio of total \\( Z \\) cross section between 13 and 5.02 TeV", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "Fiducial cross section ratio W/Z", "kind": "observable"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.087}, {"round": 2, "tool": "count", "args": {"predicate": "result_measures_observable", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 1, "error": null, "seconds": 0.004}, {"round": 3, "tool": "describe", "args": {"entity_set": "set_1", "predicate": "result_measures_observable"}, "rows": 0, "error": null, "seconds": 0.002}, {"round": 4, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:observable:fid_ratio_wz"]}, "rows": 1, "error": null, "seconds": 0.004}, {"round": 5, "tool": "papers_of", "args": {"entity_ids": ["hepkg:observable:fid_ratio_wz", "hepkg:observable:fid_ratio_wpm", "hepkg:observable:tot_ratio_wz", "hepkg:observable:fiducial_xsec_inclusive", "hepkg:observable:integrated-fiducial-xsec", "hepkg:observable:fid_enratio_z", "hepkg:observable:fid_enratio_wminus", "hepkg:observable:fid_enratio_wplus", "hepkg:observable:fid_dblratio_wz", "hepkg:observable:wz-fiducial-xsec", "hepkg:observable:tot_ratio_wpm", "hepkg:observable:fid_enratio_w", "hepkg:observable:cms-fiducial-xsec-ratio", "hepkg