{"run_id": "20260802T132734-hepkg", "qid": "gen-set-cbd02051", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate the background QCD multijet background?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql", "merged_entities"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The graph records 19 distinct analyses that estimate the QCD multijet background. Here are the specific analyses and the exact backgrounds they estimate:\n\n1. **CMS t-channel single top quark cross section measurement** (`hepkg:result:tchannel_singletop_xsec`)\n2. **Combined measurements and interpretations of Higgs boson production and decay in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)** (`hepkg:result:83e9b2efac24614b22b613d8`)\n3. **Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decays in the ATLAS detector** (`hepkg:result:c8ed964b14b2b37812ff8556`)\n4. **Constraints on anomalous Higgs boson couplings to vector bosons and fermions from the production of Higgs bosons using the final state** (`hepkg:result:5a41a7c7c62ceaef4c046044`)\n5. **HH->bb tautau analysis result** (`hepkg:result:bbtautau`)\n6. **HH->bbWW, WW->4q all-hadronic analysis result** (`hepkg:result:bbww_4q`)\n7. **Improved results on Higgs boson pair production in the 4 \\( \\mathup{{{b}} \\) final state** (`hepkg:result:c56b160307f064d9155ebd77`)\n8. **Inclusive nonresonant multilepton probes of new phenomena at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)** (`hepkg:result:c2a8c6c321f85ca4e9620c78`)\n9. **Measurement of the inclusive cross sections for \\( \\mathup{{{W}} \\) and \\( \\mathup{{{Z}} \\) boson production in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=5.02 \\) and 13 TeV** (`hepkg:result:dbe00b660bc7b95a46e94404`)\n10. **Measurement of the production cross section for a \\( \\mathup{{{W}} \\) boson in association with a charm quark in proton-proton collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{TeV} \\)** (`hepkg:result:c223e8afe1e53690005d65ee`)\n11. **Measurements of \\( WH \\) and \\( ZH \\) production in the \\( H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b} \\) decay channel in \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( 13\\, \\text{TeV} \\) with the ATLAS detector** (`hepkg:result:3c55ab19d48206f55f056f4a`)\n12. **Measurements of the production cross-sections of a Higgs boson in association with a vector boson and decaying into \\( WW^{\\\\ast} \\) with the ATLAS detector at \\( \\sqrt{s}=13 \\) TeV** (`hepkg:result:ca408cb17d5fce2b056fcc4e`)\n13. **Precise measurements of \\( W \\) - and \\( Z \\) -boson transverse momentum spectra with the ATLAS detector using \\( pp \\) collisions at \\( \\sqrt{s}=5.02 \\) TeV and 13 TeV**", "answered": true, "papers": [], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "QCD multijet", "kind": "background"}, "rows": 18, "error": null, "seconds": 0.171}, {"round": 2, "tool": "count", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 1, "error": null, "seconds": 0.006}, {"round": 3, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_estimates_background", "object_set": "set_1"}, "rows": 28, "error": null, "seconds": 0.006}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:background:bbbb_boosted_qcd_multijet", "hepkg:background:bbbb_resolved_qcd_multijet", "hepkg:background:bbtautau_qcd_multijet", "hepkg:background:bbww4q_qcd_multijet", "hepkg:background:jet-to-tauh-misid", "hepkg:background:mis-id-leptons", "hepkg:background:misid-lepton", "hepkg:background:misid_lepton", "hepkg:background:multijet", "hepkg:background:multijet-w", "hepkg:background:multijet-z", "hepkg:background:multijet_allhad_ttbar", "hepkg:background:multijet_background", "hepkg:background:multijet_tchannel", "hepkg:background:qcd-multijet", "hepkg:background:qcd-multijet-emu", "hepkg:background:qcd-singlelepton", "hepkg:background:qcd_multijet", "hepkg:background:qcd_multijet_background", "hepkg:background:sm-multijet-misiden